            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We made it for Thanksgiving, and for a family of dessert lovers it was good but\r\nit was even too sweet and rich for them. I would make it again, but I would half the\r\nsugar and corn syrup and it would still be sweet enough. I would also cover the top\r\nof the pie in the last 20 minutes of baking - the top got very brown even when it\r\nwasn't done enough inside so it was a little soupy. The next day it was excellent.",
            "datePublished": "2000-12-02T10:42:30.670Z"
